  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1123.01 Conducting Administrative Due Process Hearings. Administrative due process hearings shall be conducted in compliance with applicable state and federal laws and regulations, including 34 CFR 300.507-.518.\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1100) #9197, eff 6-28-08; ss by #12141, eff 3-24-17",
